WEBVTT

00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:19,550
Okay, um, question that came in is intermittent fasting always better than spacing your food out through the day, same amount of food.

00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:31,550
Um, yes, I think you're talking about if you ate three meals a day, you're spacing the food out, you have four hours in between each meal.

00:00:31,550 --> 00:00:35,550
Um, what's the benefit of intermittent fasting over that?

00:00:35,550 --> 00:00:52,550
Um, it's very, it's very different. So if you're only eating within a window of let's say three to six PM every day, you only have a three hour feeding window, you're basically fasting for 21 hours a day, you get.

00:00:52,550 --> 00:00:57,550
There's lots of different benefits of fasting and I have several blog posts on that.

00:00:57,550 --> 00:01:08,550
So it is, um, much more beneficial to, um, to do it that way, to do that high restricted eating slash intermittent fasting.

00:01:08,550 --> 00:01:12,550
Oh, it's not that you have to do every day and it's not necessarily something you should do every day.

00:01:12,550 --> 00:01:19,550
But to do that once to twice three four or five times a week, it can be very beneficial to any of what you're trying to tell us.

